url: "https://github.com/ljbudgie/burgess-principle"
abstract: >-
  The Burgess Principle is a binary institutional accountability standard.
  One question: was a human mind with proper authority individually applied
  to the specific facts of this specific person's case? Outcomes are SOVEREIGN,
  NULL, or AMBIGUOUS. UK Certification Mark UK00004343685. MIT licence.
